  <data key="d2">Acetaminophen does not reduce inflammation, unlike aspirin.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammation is the localized immune reaction of body tissue to injury or irritation, characterized by redness, swelling, heat, pain, and possible loss of function.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammation is a key term related to immune response.</data>
