  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Corticosteroids are steroid drugs that can affect skin conditions and may influence acne severity.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are anti-inflammatory medications used to treat nasal inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are anti-inflammatory medications used to treat nasal inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are a key term noted as powerful anti-inflammatory agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are drugs mentioned as a treatment option for immune or idiopathic platelet disorders.</data>
