<node id="Abscess">
  <data key="d0">Abscess</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An abscess is an infected skin nodule containing pus that may require drainage if it does not respond to antibiotics, with prognosis depending on underlying causes and complications.&lt;SEP&gt;An abscess is a collection of pus formed during anaerobic infection, serving as a diagnostic indicator.&lt;SEP&gt;An abscess is a pocket of infection containing pus.</data>
