<node id="Musculoskeletal System">
  <data key="d0">Musculoskeletal System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Musculoskeletal System is a body system composed of muscles, bones, joints, and associated connective tissues such as tendons, ligaments, and fascia. By integrating hard (bone) and soft (muscle) components, it provides the structural framework of the body, protects vital internal organs, supports posture, enables both voluntary and involuntary movement, and facilitates locomotion. The system is listed among the major body systems that can be implicated in a wide range of physiological and pathological contexts, including immune‑complex testing, immunosuppression, blood‑pressure changes, hypothyroidism, insulin resistance, and localized conditions such as an impacted tooth.

The Musculoskeletal System is the primary site of many orthopedic disorders, including hammertoe, heel spurs, and various forms of arthritis. It can be involved in infectious processes such as infectious arthritis, abscess formation, and Haemophilus infections, and may contribute to complications of severe systemic illnesses such as acute kidney failure, heart failure, graft‑versus‑host disease, peripheral vascular disease, and Peyronie’s disease. Traumatic events (e.g., amputation), genetic disorders such as ataxia‑telangiectasia, occupational exposures like asbestosis, and viral diseases such as poliomyelitis can produce inflammation or structural damage; post‑polio syndrome and progressive supranuclear palsy are also noted to affect the system. Primary biliary cirrhosis and other systemic autoimmune conditions may involve musculoskeletal manifestations, and the system is considered relevant in prepregnancy counseling because of its impact on maternal health and fetal outcomes.

Clinical assessment of the Musculoskeletal System often incorporates endocrine and metabolic evaluations; growth‑hormone testing routinely examines musculoskeletal response, and the aldolase test is used to detect muscle injury. Imaging modalities—including pelvic ultrasound, radiography, MRI, and CT—are employed to evaluate bones, joints, and soft tissues. Various drug classes influence the system: antinausea medications have been reported to alter musculoskeletal function, while anabolic steroids can increase muscle mass and bone density. Therapeutic interventions range from conventional medical and surgical treatments (e.g., gastrostomy placement, craniotomy, hernia repair) to manual and movement‑based techniques such as acupressure, the Alexander Technique, and Aston‑Patterning, all aimed at improving posture, reducing pain, and enhancing functional movement. These approaches underscore the Musculoskeletal System’s pivotal role in health, disease, diagnosis, and therapy across a broad spectrum of medical contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Musculoskeletal system is one of the body systems mentioned as affected by psoriatic arthritis.&lt;SEP&gt;Musculoskeletal System is a body system listed as involved in the pathophysiology of pseudogout.&lt;SEP&gt;The musculoskeletal system, listed as a body system involved in rabies cases, includes muscles and bones.&lt;SEP&gt;The musculoskeletal system includes muscles and bones that support bodily movement.&lt;SEP&gt;The musculoskeletal system is listed among body systems associated with rectal cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Musculoskeletal System is a body system evaluated by reflex tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4c57ef53ddb01cbbf235608d43c7612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a42943ad0f93e6631565dc2c851d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29429d857edf1192105634eda51b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b2f2e3046d0f775744775822b8b1381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb8410ab80dc1278656666cc6ce9a2b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-919116bb6efe3303887cfaa1a2474f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2718c6e6fa21ad7d51803e9bd95a0fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9afe775e3de6a2ede3813b294c2d7085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe1b59b257b5d344c7de5181dbff9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a321ea72ebe4c42d67faa7f47af64c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ff1c28387bf5cdbd9396931e1ac3bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9098e6c377264351e34498ab20d1d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e04fc4d9139221a4e00a150baf448e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d527eab17c7341eca433d361df1f72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d5f8eb7b45a1ef3316ab36b4d963198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bcaad1542ea8e041fd9f427e13e25c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a3b3c33dc539d83724153cf8bd92691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aaee80ad65e061c4dbd83e81542c322&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd702733210b77bd85a84e3b0046cb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ccba52c964c301daf559927d7d7c5e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0562388bfd043886184b76d26796a668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca82475bbfe64d98c513d42669176ff3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cdce04fe6b7fc2f2383ff5401c7803f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bace5728e2cd20cde6babfc53bd224f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170bf8fe0c421cc796fb1a155cc92877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31523ff9a2a651ce41cbc96e86cccd97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6407dc79c35579b5387abf2b05a97d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75141ec103928f9f43bbc8f2d882b9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a89a85dc3be8d37412b0c61ebf99cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97c12585544967d7c896d91a36a80447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2408b24dbbf82011285a46aaece84afd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a98908cc7f18fa4c5b0c4a45575393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8123b7be7ff18b176f9e2f5778b3e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a43117074cce1d59c31131832dfa007&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9afb199a3e40198055fdd9a325ecd1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeb4dffb5ad505f4839faaa747910b3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91b63fc7d102b55c2843666075d6ad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07cc217c989e2af1a805d2ee5017b0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eff6cb4281c913c830bd641c706365c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa850befaee3ce9863ec83a8dbb56b00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc235c34c37663ee