<node id="White Blood Cells">
  <data key="d0">White Blood Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">White blood cells are immune cells involved in responding to infection such as an abscess.&lt;SEP&gt;White blood cells are mature blood cells that fight infection.&lt;SEP&gt;White Blood Cells are immune cells that infiltrate the liver during autoimmune hepatitis and release damaging chemicals.</data>
