  <data key="d2">Reflux irritates the esophagus and leads to heartburn.&lt;SEP&gt;... That's correct. Same for Gastroesophageal Reflux. Esophagus line also correct format. Lower Esophageal Sphincter line was cut off; missing description. That is incorrectly formatted/missing fields. So we must output corrected Lower Esophageal Sphincter entity.&lt;SEP&gt;Burning sensation in chest extending to neck, throat, face; primary symptom of gastroesophageal reflux; worsened by bending or lying down; common condition affecting &gt;1/3 population.</data>
