<node id="Aspirin">
  <data key="d0">Aspirin</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13d7186c36bc114fd063d81d9835a694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4ef02fa72700fb047729ed50bb1182a</data>
  <data key="d2">Acetylsalicylic acid is the chemical name for aspirin.&lt;SEP&gt;Aspirin is a medication that, when overdosed, can lead to salicylate poisoning.</data>
