<node id="Acid Phosphatase Test">
  <data key="d0">Acid Phosphatase Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Acid Phosphatase Test is a diagnostic test used to diagnose whether prostate cancer has spread (metastasized) and to check treatment effectiveness; largely supplanted by PSA test.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-380c6702cc605a3cfe1200c7e02a7fb6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373609</data>
</node>
<node id="Acid Phosphatase">
  <data key="d0">Acid Phosphatase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Acid Phosphatase is an enzyme found throughout the body, primarily in the prostate gland; highly concentrated in semen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-380c6702cc605a3cfe1200c7e02a7fb6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373609</data>
</node>
<node id="Prostate Gland">
  <data key="d0">Prostate Gland</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Prostate Gland is the male gland that contains high levels of acid phosphatase (100 times more than other body parts).&lt;SEP&gt;organ whose growth in older men can restrict urine flow and cause hydronephrosis.&lt;SEP&gt;The prostate gland is a male reproductive organ composed of glandular, smooth muscle, and stromal cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a51c332fdfaf8c96be6ab58c809b221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edfaa9dba99a768f9ffcf5c77b2d0525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380c6702cc605a3cfe1200c7e02a7fb6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786424791</data>
</node>
<node id="Prostate Cancer">
  <data key="d0">Prostate Cancer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Prostate Cancer is a disease that can metastasize; the test diagnoses its spread.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate cancer is a disease of the prostate gland whose aggressiveness is assessed using the Gleason Score, PSA levels, and biopsy results.&lt;SEP&gt;cancer that can obstruct urine flow along pathways, contributing to hydronephrosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Prostate cancer is the most common cancer among men over 50 in the United States and a leading cause of cancer death.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a51c332fdfaf8c96be6ab58c809b221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-627b1597e2ff9fd7f303859f27a292f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380c6702cc605a3cfe1200c7e02a7fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abbfd6cbf4afd6662ba2707fbc17c147</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786424845</data>
</node>
