<node id="Puncture Site">
  <data key="d0">Puncture Site</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Puncture Site is the location where the test sample is taken; may experience discomfort, bruising, bleeding.&lt;SEP&gt;The location where blood is drawn for the test, which may experience discomfort or bruising.&lt;SEP&gt;Puncture site is the location on the body where blood is drawn for a hemoglobin test.&lt;SEP&gt;Puncture site refers to the location on the body where a needle is inserted for blood collection, potentially experiencing discomfort or bleeding.&lt;SEP&gt;Puncture Site is the location where blood is drawn for the Partial Thromboplastin Time test and requires aftercare.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b785ff55416d26c9c9d2574c29ca4711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b2f2e3046d0f775744775822b8b1381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380c6702cc605a3cfe1200c7e02a7fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80e03e36082a52818b6740d8905c8a42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec14d30df69d510d9dcaa9c0f8a32fd9</data>
