  <data key="d2">The adrenal cortex is the outer part of the adrenal gland.&lt;SEP&gt;Adrenal Gland is an organ consisting of an outer cortex that releases hormones in response to ACTH.&lt;SEP&gt;The adrenal gland is an organ that produces hormones and is affected by progressive dysfunction in Adrenoleukodystrophy.</data>
