<node id="Neurotransmitter">
  <data key="d0">Neurotransmitter</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neurotransmitter refers to chemical messengers like dopamine involved in addiction.&lt;SEP&gt;Neurotransmitter refers to chemical messengers in the brain, such as dopamine, norepinephrine, and serotonin, whose availability is influenced by appetite suppressant drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2df310a5eb710fa15878efbe7d25bc7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fff53a187c372ebdee1b2526a7ad3f69</data>
