<node id="Acupuncture">
  <data key="d0">Acupuncture</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Acupuncture is a traditional needle‑based therapy that stimulates specific points on the body, sharing the same points used in acupressure.&lt;SEP&gt;Acupuncture is a therapeutic technique that uses sharp thin needles inserted at specific points to adjust the body’s energy flow and treat various illnesses, classified as an alternative therapy.</data>
