  <data key="d2">The Yellow Emperor’s Classic of Internal Medicine is an ancient Chinese medical text, roughly 2,500 years old, cited as an origin of Chinese medicine knowledge.&lt;SEP&gt;The Yellow Emperor’s Classic of Internal Medicine is a foundational Chinese medical text dating back approximately 2,500 years.</data>
