<node id="Streptococcus Pyogenes">
  <data key="d0">Streptococcus Pyogenes</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Streptococcus pyogenes is a bacterium identified as the most common cause of acute lymphangitis and also known for causing strep throat and other infections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bead2f9ad4273b49f336c30d5e85e2f1</data>
