<node id="Intravenous Fluids">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Fluids</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Intravenous fluids are fluids delivered through a vein to treat acute lymphangitis and support patients, especially those with kidney failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous fluids are a medical treatment administered to address severe dehydration and electrolyte imbalance.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous fluids are medical fluids administered through a vein to correct dehydration and electrolyte imbalance.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous fluids are administered to patients with normal kidney function to clear excess calcium in hypercalcemia treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccd7967460bd192566c346ccf6adf5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea23812b7285588a42ea7c6a323d1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bead2f9ad4273b49f336c30d5e85e2f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8189651eadb45a933adca499117c49ad</data>
