  <data key="d0">Family Doctor</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Family doctor is a medical professional who may diagnose acute lymphangitis.&lt;SEP&gt;Family doctor is a primary care medical professional who can diagnose and treat genital herpes.</data>
