<node id="Energy Flow">
  <data key="d0">Energy Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Energy flow refers to the movement of vital energy (qi) within the body, which acupuncture aims to adjust.&lt;SEP&gt;Energy flow denotes the movement of electromagnetic energy within the body, central to the theory of polarity therapy.</data>
