  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrocortisone, also known as cortisol, is a hormone released by the adrenal cortex in response to ACTH stimulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44b884468a26dc2957843352da600dce</data>
