<node id="Cushings Syndrome">
  <data key="d0">Cushings Syndrome</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cushing’s Syndrome is a medical condition characterized by excess cortisol production, which can be detected by the ACTH test.&lt;SEP&gt;Cushing’s syndrome is referenced in the abnormal results section, indicating a condition related to hormonal imbalance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44b884468a26dc2957843352da600dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1571076590b816bc3bb0de3b67b9a10</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
