  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ICD Category E40-E68 classifies nutrition-related disorders in the International Classification of Diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic coding range covering various forms of malnutrition, including undernutrition.&lt;SEP&gt;ICD Category E40-E68 is the diagnostic code range assigned to protein-energy malnutrition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afbff98c4c1d63870e1df4480f9167fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9acb51065e727736eeeac34449f610b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efefc9a9914255b2db7998e6ff75be31</data>
