<node id="Blood Vessel Formation">
  <data key="d0">Blood Vessel Formation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Vessel Formation is the process of creating new blood vessels, which Celebrex inhibits, reducing scar tissue development.</data>
