<node id="Systemic Anti-inflammatory Medications">
  <data key="d0">Systemic Anti-inflammatory Medications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Systemic anti-inflammatory medications are drugs administered throughout the body to reduce inflammation and may be used to prevent adhesion formation.</data>
