  <data key="d0">Lorenzos Oil</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lorenzo’s Oil is a mixture shown to reduce long‑chain fatty acid levels when used long term, though it does not affect myelin loss.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b1571076590b816bc3bb0de3b67b9a10</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
