  <data key="d2">description. Types match allowed list: concept, naturalobject, method, artifact, data, person. All lower case? Allowed types case? In examples they used lower case (e.g., person). So fine.&lt;SEP&gt;description. No missing fields. Are there any typos? "Dermatological System" vs just "Dermatological". Acceptable.&lt;SEP&gt;description". Ensure no extra spaces.&lt;SEP&gt;description&lt;SEP&gt;description.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d028b3e3f4cefe67cb0e2fd00c4e75c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1571076590b816bc3bb0de3b67b9a10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3046439ce6fa1d6d5f63b57269a3f9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d76104bef49b3189628a31424cb580f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26ab204b849d6c7971a47fef9609df62</data>
