<node id="Prenatal Testing">
  <data key="d0">Prenatal Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Prenatal Testing is a method to detect Alagille Syndrome before birth.&lt;SEP&gt;Prenatal testing is a genetic procedure that can detect ATM gene defects in a fetus but is not routinely performed.&lt;SEP&gt;Prenatal testing is an area of expertise for gynecologists as described in the entry.&lt;SEP&gt;Prenatal testing is mentioned as a possible method for detecting certain porphyrias before birth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c10b11558c17065dc27bd62ccb0fb84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb8410ab80dc1278656666cc6ce9a2b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02740b694bb0616d4b4005a09fd946b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07a9a426a4bb2afd30f9a958bbb935d6</data>
