<node id="Chorionic Villus Sampling">
  <data key="d0">Chorionic Villus Sampling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Chorionic Villus Sampling is a prenatal testing method for Alagille Syndrome.&lt;SEP&gt;Chorionic villus sampling (CVS) is a prenatal procedure that collects placental tissue to diagnose chromosomal disorders such as Patau Syndrome.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96db15f8221b080d39a0f8664e928222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02740b694bb0616d4b4005a09fd946b</data>
