<node id="Kidney Disease">
  <data key="d0">Kidney Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Kidney Disease is a possible complication of Alagille Syndrome.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney disease encompasses disorders of the kidneys, often managed with diuretic therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney disease is a condition for which fluid balance is checked with pulmonary artery catheterization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c02740b694bb0616d4b4005a09fd946b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8a0239df88721094e3c51f8a7373134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b7e1ff6aefba50b9ab4cb48e8298cf0</data>
