  <data key="d0">Survival Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Survival Rate refers to the proportion of Alagille Syndrome patients living to certain ages.&lt;SEP&gt;Survival Rate denotes the percentage of patients who survive five years or more after diagnosis of head and neck cancers.</data>
