<node id="Phobia">
  <data key="d0">Phobia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Phobia is an intense and irrational fear of a specific object, activity, or situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Phobia is an intense, irrational fear that can be related to anxiety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b7ae47fed28c48dbd20bd5a3891afd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecb82b4c17b2ce7e9445ff42d2200be</data>
