<node id="Panic Attack">
  <data key="d0">Panic Attack</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Panic Attack refers to episodes of dread or panic that may accompany agoraphobia, featuring trembling, sweating, heart palpitations, jitters, fatigue, tingling, nausea, rapid pulse or breathing, and a sense of impending doom.&lt;SEP&gt;The active presentation of panic disorder, characterized by a discrete, rapid onset of intense fear or discomfort accompanied by somatic or cognitive symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b7ae47fed28c48dbd20bd5a3891afd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85e93febb58ca4aaa7f3d9330268ffbf</data>
