<node id="Alexander Technique">
  <data key="d0">Alexander Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Alexander Technique is a somatic method for improving physical and mental functioning by reducing excessive tension and restoring freedom of movement and clear thinking.</data>
