<node id="Frederick Matthias Alexander">
  <data key="d0">Frederick Matthias Alexander</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Frederick Matthias Alexander (1869–?) is the originator of the Alexander Technique, born in Tasmania, Australia, who worked as an actor and Shakespearean reciter before developing the method.</data>
