  <data key="d2">Enzyme is mentioned as a key&lt;SEP&gt;Enzyme refers to biological catalysts involved in the biochemical pathway that synthesizes melanin.&lt;SEP&gt;Enzyme is a biological catalyst, with Aldolase being a specific example that facilitates chemical reactions in muscles.&lt;SEP&gt;Enzyme is listed as a key term related to antioxidants.</data>
