<node id="Allergic Purpura">
  <data key="d0">Allergic Purpura</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Allergic Purpura is an allergic reaction causing red patches on the skin and other symptoms, also known as Henoch–Schönlein Purpura.</data>
