<node id="Capillaries">
  <data key="d0">Capillaries</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Capillaries are small blood vessels that can become blocked by antigen–antibody complexes in Allergic Purpura.&lt;SEP&gt;Capillaries are small blood vessels involved in blood circulation, relevant to platelet transport.</data>
