<node id="Gastrointestinal Tract">
  <data key="d0">Gastrointestinal Tract</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The gastrointestinal tract can be involved in Allergic Purpura, showing complications.&lt;SEP&gt;The gastrointestinal tract is a body location where anaerobic bacteria are normally found.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e46cef0181d6e65ea01360302ddd1f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1acfa8b3bcf6abb174b1db6c3878690</data>
