  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin biopsy is a diagnostic method used to assess Allergic Purpura.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin biopsy is a diagnostic method that removes a skin specimen for&lt;SEP&gt;Skin biopsy is a procedure to obtain a skin tissue sample for confirming the diagnosis of ichthyosis.</data>
