<node id="X Ray">
  <data key="d0">X Ray</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">X ray is an imaging method used to assess complications in Allergic Purpura.&lt;SEP&gt;X ray (radiographic) imaging is used in angiography to capture images of blood vessels.&lt;SEP&gt;X ray (radiographic) imaging is used in angiography to capture images of blood vessels.&lt;SEP&gt;Chest X‑ray imaging is a key diagnostic study for evaluating hemoptysis.&lt;SEP&gt;X ray is an imaging study used to assess the presence and location of obstructions in hydrocephalus.&lt;SEP&gt;X ray is a type of radiation used in radiology to create images of body parts by exposing them to low-dose radiation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c190f7502921527346a5beaed7b2382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b10aa104383eb3ba74165d13d525ae5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-414a580eb00a7d0d58696314c2aa7dfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e46cef0181d6e65ea01360302ddd1f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bc0e87b467a3072004e86dd7a21ec8c</data>
