<node id="Viral Hepatitis">
  <data key="d0">Viral Hepatitis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Viral hepatitis is a liver infection that can increase alkaline phosphatase levels, mentioned in the Allergic Purpura entry.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammation of the liver caused by infection with a hepatitis virus.&lt;SEP&gt;Viral hepatitis is an infectious disease that inflames the liver and shares similar symptoms with drug‑induced hepatitis.</data>
