  <data key="d2">John Bavosi is credited alongside Photo Researchers, Inc. for the illustration depicting allergic rhinitis symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc. is credited as the source of the image associated with the impetigo entry.&lt;SEP&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc. is an organization credited for a photograph of a photosensitivity skin rash.&lt;SEP&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc. is the organization credited alongside Dr. P. Marazzi for providing the photo of Pityriasis Rosea.</data>
