  <data key="d2">Laboratory is a book authored by Cynthia C. Chernecky and Barbara J. Berger that includes information on the Aldolase Test.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory conducts amylase testing using various methods and reagents.&lt;SEP&gt;The laboratory is the setting where laboratory personnel evaluate hCG test results.</data>
