  <data key="d0">Newborn</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Newborn refers to a newborn individual who has the highest normal aldolase levels in blood.&lt;SEP&gt;A newborn is an infant at birth; the primary population on which amino acid disorders screening is conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;The newborn is the infant patient evaluated by Apgar Testing through five physiological criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708af40669770fee42a9a9b052181fce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af3262684a537f83a047b77ed5ae0b70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-919116bb6efe3303887cfaa1a2474f3d</data>
