<node id="Alcoholism">
  <data key="d0">Alcoholism</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alcoholism is a chronic physical, psychological, and behavioral disorder characterized by excessive use of alcoholic beverages, dependence, tolerance, and withdrawal symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcoholism is excessive alcohol consumption identified as a cause of heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcoholism is chronic excessive alcohol consumption that can secondary cause hyperhidrosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-910d4bcf6932bd29fd1d161e11852b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b5b4ede4683a3be477e4527fbbb8cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed665cb566f37b833eec31484ae9ff6</data>
