  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Behavioral therapy is a therapeutic approach indicated for treating alcoholism.&lt;SEP&gt;Behavioral therapy is a therapeutic method that can be used alongside antidepressant drugs to control depression.&lt;SEP&gt;Behavioral Therapy is a therapeutic method used to avoid reinforcing hysterical symptoms.</data>
