  <data key="d0">Anabolic Steroid Use</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anabolic Steroid Use is a condition involving the non‑prescribed consumption of anabolic‑androgenic steroids that leads to multiple health effects.</data>
