<node id="Anabolic‑Androgenic Steroids">
  <data key="d0">Anabolic‑Androgenic Steroids</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Anabolic‑androgenic steroids are man‑made drugs chemically related to the male hormone testosterone and are used to increase muscle mass.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-170bf8fe0c421cc796fb1a155cc92877</data>
