<node id="Myocardial Infarction">
  <data key="d0">Myocardial Infarction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Myocardial&lt;SEP&gt;Myocardial infarction is a blockage of a coronary artery that cuts off the blood supply to part of the heart.&lt;SEP&gt;Myocardial infarction is a blockage of a coronary artery that cuts off the blood supply to part of the heart.&lt;SEP&gt;Myocardial Infarction is a heart attack and stroke, complications of hypertension.&lt;SEP&gt;A blockage of blood supply to the heart, commonly known as a heart attack, described in the test description.&lt;SEP&gt;Myocardial Infarction is an alternative medical term that refers to a heart attack.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-895c5e07d9ff1dcdf835a5d197d6cf8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b2f2e3046d0f775744775822b8b1381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80337a816ac74c4f4d818c5c4c8c74d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d6c274f816e9066576ca6cf4bef367a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170bf8fe0c421cc796fb1a155cc92877</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
