  <data key="d0">Tetanus</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Tetanus is a disease caused by anaerobic bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Tetanus is a bacterial disease that can be transmitted through ear piercing under non‑sterile conditions.</data>
