  <data key="d0">Medical History</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical history provides diagnostic information for anaerobic infection.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical History is a diagnostic method involving review of a patient’s past health information, used to assess heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical history is a diagnostic method involving the collection of a patient’s past health information to aid in diagnosing infectious diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;..." correct.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical history is the collection of a patient's past health information used by physicians to diagnose rashes.</data>
