<node id="Arthroscopic Surgery">
  <data key="d0">Arthroscopic Surgery</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A minimally invasive surgical technique that visualizes and treats problems inside joints using small incisions and an arthroscope.&lt;SEP&gt;A minimally invasive surgical technique that visualizes and treats problems inside joints using small incisions and an arthroscope.&lt;SEP&gt;Arthroscopic surgery is the repair phase performed when arthroscopy includes actual surgical repair of joint structures.</data>
