<node id="Surgical Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Surgical Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A medical operation performed to diagnose or treat a condition, encompassing interventions such as arthroscopic surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical operation performed to diagnose or treat a condition, encompassing interventions such as arthroscopic surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical Procedure is the entry type classification for General surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical Procedure refers to operations performed by surgeons to treat medical conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical procedure is an operative intervention that can introduce pathogens directly into a joint, causing infectious arthritis.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical procedures are medical operations performed to treat or modify body structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical Procedure refers to an operative medical technique, of which Pyloroplasty is an example.</data>
