<node id="Anesthesia">
  <data key="d0">Anesthesia</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Anesthesia is a medication administered by a medical professional to reduce or prevent pain during surgery, with four main types: general, local, regional, and epidural.&lt;SEP&gt;Anesthesia is a medication administered by a medical professional to reduce or prevent pain during surgery, with four main types: general, local, regional, and epidural.&lt;SEP&gt;Anesthesia is a medical method used during surgery that can cause shallower breathing post‑operatively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b980f05326d81e805160717f42418e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2056dc204f71f79fef28e7940fdf482f</data>
