<node id="Local Anesthesia">
  <data key="d0">Local Anesthesia</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Local anesthesia involves injection or application of an anesthetic to block pain in a specific region while the patient remains conscious.&lt;SEP&gt;Local anesthesia involves injection or application of an anesthetic to block pain in a specific region while the patient remains conscious.&lt;SEP&gt;Local anesthesia is a method of anesthesia that may be used during a gastrostomy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b980f05326d81e805160717f42418e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a321ea72ebe4c42d67faa7f47af64c7</data>
