<node id="Regional Anesthesia">
  <data key="d0">Regional Anesthesia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Regional anesthesia involves injection or application of an anesthetic to block pain in a larger area of the body, often used for surgeries on a specific region.&lt;SEP&gt;Regional anesthesia involves injection or application of an anesthetic to block pain in a larger area of the body, often used for surgeries on a specific region.</data>
