  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Symptoms of anaphylaxis include urticaria, swelling, difficulty breathing, and wheezing.&lt;SEP&gt;Symptoms of anaphylaxis include urticaria, swelling, difficulty breathing, and wheezing.</data>
