  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Urticaria, also known as hives, is a skin manifestation of anaphylaxis characterized by raised, itchy welts.&lt;SEP&gt;Urticaria, also known as hives, is a skin manifestation of anaphylaxis characterized by raised, itchy welts.</data>
