  <data key="d2">Difficulty breathing results from airway constriction and inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Difficulty breathing results from airway constriction and inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Difficulty breathing is a somatic symptom of anxiety involving shortness of breath.</data>
