  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Wheezing is a respiratory symptom caused by bronchial constriction.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheezing is a respiratory symptom caused by bronchial constriction.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheezing is a high-pitched whistling sound produced during breathing and is a hallmark symptom of asthma attacks.</data>
