  <data key="d0">Icd Category</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Icd Category refers to the classification system that includes Z-codes for medical procedures.`&lt;SEP&gt;Icd Category refers to the classification system that includes Z-codes for medical procedures.`&lt;SEP&gt;Icd Category denotes the coding group (such as Z-codes) used to classify medical procedures.</data>
