<node id="Hypothalamus">
  <data key="d0">Hypothalamus</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The hypothalamus is a gland located in the brain that produces hormones influencing hormone regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Brain region that produces antidiuretic hormone.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypothalamus is a brain region implicated in the regulation of anxiety.&lt;SEP&gt;The hypothalamus is an endocrine organ in the brain that controls the pituitary gland by issuing hormonal signals.&lt;SEP&gt;The hypothalamus is a brain region that secretes gonadotropin‑releasing hormone to initiate puberty.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6f6eb6351953e7ef79475828425af93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee26fc83e6a72a8d68824995539e61e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6409c7c91c51d8723b72f6697dc5c8cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-427a659d0ef51d2588b292e6329fb824&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecb82b4c17b2ce7e9445ff42d2200be</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
