<node id="Dehydration">
  <data key="d0">Dehydration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dehydration is a condition of reduced body fluid, which is a concern in patients with diarrhea caused by antibiotic-associated colitis.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration is a severe loss of body fluids caused by excessive vomiting in hyperemesis gravidarum.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration is a physiological condition that can result from fluid loss, which fluids aim to prevent in peritonitis patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a65a1c3cf6b8503607afdabf8b0202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a3ecc34ed1c5383ab2125e8cf323393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea23812b7285588a42ea7c6a323d1b6</data>
