  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Colon is the part of the large intestine that becomes inflamed in colitis.&lt;SEP&gt;The colon is part of the large bowel that precedes the rectum and continues the digestive process.&lt;SEP&gt;The colon is a segment of the large intestine located proximal to the rectum.&lt;SEP&gt;The..." The text was truncated.&lt;SEP&gt;The...</data>
