<node id="Canada">
  <data key="d0">Canada</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Canada is a country where antiangiogenic drugs such as bevacizumab, sorafenib, sunitinib, thalidomide, and erlotinib are approved for use.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country where many antibiotics are approved for use.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country where no hepatitis E outbreaks have been reported.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country where rabies cases are infrequent, averaging one or two per year.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-43384133dfe3fd1b2a03d01d15878f94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b14c26a47ca283ef7a5696f26a6c99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a89a85dc3be8d37412b0c61ebf99cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebc93901c908c91f026b8f84613ebc71</data>
