<node id="Antidepressant Drugs">
  <data key="d0">Antidepressant Drugs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antidepressant Drugs are medicines that increase excitatory neurotransmitter levels and are used as first‑line treatment for depression, sometimes together with behavioral therapy or exercise.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidepressant Drugs are a class of medications prescribed primarily to treat mental depression and related disorders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99238eefb790bd6f517ddd61b96753ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043b5eeeac66113551273095596cd117</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786385036</data>
</node>
<node id="Norepinephrine">
  <data key="d0">Norepinephrine</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Norepinephrine is an excitatory neurotransmitter whose levels are increased by antidepressant drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Norepinephrine is a neurotransmitter whose availability may be increased by appetite suppressant drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99238eefb790bd6f517ddd61b96753ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fff53a187c372ebdee1b2526a7ad3f69</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786389545</data>
</node>
<node id="Exercise">
  <data key="d0">Exercise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Exercise is a physical activity method used in conjunction with antidepressant drugs to manage depression.&lt;SEP&gt;Exercise is a recommended physical activity regimen, including walking, bicycling, swimming, or low‑impact aerobic exercise, to improve health in heart failure patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Exercise, especially regular moderate activity, has been shown to improve motor function in individuals with Parkinson’s disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Exercise involves physical activity, included as a component of polarity therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Exercise is an aspect discussed in prepregnancy counseling focusing on physical activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca4ee33fbe169b1bec7c819c96b35eb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2887ebc17d5fa167b3627fd14696de82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99238eefb790bd6f517ddd61b96753ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-910d4bcf6932bd29fd1d161e11852b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0562388bfd043886184b76d26796a668</data>
