  <data key="d2">Moderate severity indicates the level of seriousness assigned to anticancer drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Indicates the severity level assigned to the phlebotomy procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Moderate severity indicates the typical level of disease impact for psoriatic arthritis.</data>
