<node id="Cholesterol">
  <data key="d0">Cholesterol</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cholesterol is a substance referenced in relation to antihyperlipidemic drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cholesterol is a fatty substance that can accumulate on artery walls and break off, forming an embolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Cholesterol is a lipid molecule whose distribution in blood influences vascular disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Cholesterol is an essential molecule that circulates in the bloodstream and whose elevated levels define hypercholesterolemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d89b7b5832dd7ae55e8a5dd5f4a4a94a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd4e9159e066f72729a8b0e6c804cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30319cce70ff00cde3c2e324df5816f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09ac7fad90c3ef5bbb1366ea8a473928</data>
