<node id="Viral Infection">
  <data key="d0">Viral Infection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Viral infection is an irritation that may trigger chronic inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Viral infection refers to viral agents that can spread to joints and cause infectious arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97c12585544967d7c896d91a36a80447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a69ca28e7676455bc1dd105b09f56c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786411979</data>
</node>
<node id="Trauma">
  <data key="d0">Trauma</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Trauma is an irritant that can cause chronic inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Trauma is a physical injury that can lead to rapidly developing acute ascites as a complication.&lt;SEP&gt;Trauma refers to extensive injury that influences the prognosis of low blood pressure.&lt;SEP&gt;Trauma is listed as a possible cause of brain cell degeneration leading to parkinsonism.&lt;SEP&gt;Trauma is listed as a possible risk factor for prostatitis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a05c379dcf013630337bc48911a2ab86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97c12585544967d7c896d91a36a80447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a3b3c33dc539d83724153cf8bd92691&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2887ebc17d5fa167b3627fd14696de82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62b13a067bbff6ba6a45d67ea3a11ea</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786424717</data>
</node>
<node id="Cigarette Smoke">
  <data key="d0">Cigarette Smoke</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cigarette smoke is an irritant linked to chronic inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cigarette smoke is a toxin that can increase free radical formation.</data>
