  <data key="d2">Antiulcer drugs affect infectious conditions as listed among body systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Infectious is listed among the body systems relevant to the procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Infectious denotes conditions related to infection, listed among body systems relevant to Pyloroplasty.</data>
