  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Nonsteroidal Anti-Inflammatory Drugs (NSAIDs) are a major class of antirheumatic drugs that provide symptomatic relief of inflammation and pain.&lt;SEP&gt;Nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs are standard arthritis treatments used for symptom control but do not affect psoriasis lesions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bd702733210b77bd85a84e3b0046cb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8d7c7d33c329cb3906f743fc78b5fa</data>
