<node id="Rheumatoid Arthritis">
  <data key="d0">Rheumatoid Arthritis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rheumatoid Arthritis is a chronic inflammatory disease targeted by antirheumatic drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Rheumatoid Arthritis is an autoimmune disease associated with excess immune complexes.&lt;SEP&gt;Rheumatoid arthritis is an autoimmune disease treated by immunosuppressant drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Rheumatoid arthritis is another type of arthritis that is generally more severe than psoriatic arthritis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bd702733210b77bd85a84e3b0046cb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e8d7c7d33c329cb3906f743fc78b5fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8049c6dc0f71e37cbd8d3611d0687a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aeb4dffb5ad505f4839faaa747910b3c</data>
