  <data key="d2">Homeopathy approaches anxiety as a symptom of a systemic disorder.&lt;SEP&gt;Homeopathy is an alternative practice mentioned as trying to determine allergic substances causing reactions in patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Homeopathy is the same holistic treatment system as homeopathic medicine, based on the principle that like cures like using highly diluted substances.</data>
