  <data key="d2">Herpes simplex causes sores on the lips known as cold sores.&lt;SEP&gt;Herpes simplex is a virus that can trigger impetigo in a person, as described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Herpes simplex (genital herpes) is a sexually transmitted viral infection listed as a cause of Proctitis.</data>
