  <data key="d2">Thrombophlebitis is listed as&lt;SEP&gt;Thrombophlebitis is inflammation of a vein with clot formation, cited as a complication of arthroscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;Thrombophlebitis is inflammation of a vein associated with a blood clot.</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
