<node id="Gastrostomy">
  <data key="d0">Gastrostomy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Gastrostomy is a surgical procedure for inserting a tube through the abdominal wall into the stomach, used for feeding or drainage.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastrostomy is a surgical procedure to place a feeding tube, used to address severe feeding problems in infants with Patau Syndrome.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96db15f8221b080d39a0f8664e928222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a321ea72ebe4c42d67faa7f47af64c7</data>
