<node id="Stoma">
  <data key="d0">Stoma</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The stoma is an opening created in the skin and stomach during a gastrostomy, approximately the diameter of a small pencil.&lt;SEP&gt;Stoma is an opening created in the skin of the abdomen to allow urine drainage into an ostomy bag.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1a321ea72ebe4c42d67faa7f47af64c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-857d781bfe6e2b60c49450d61d8306db</data>
