<node id="Surgeon">
  <data key="d0">Surgeon</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A surgeon is a medical professional who can perform a gastrostomy procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgeon is a medical professional who may perform surgical repair of a perforated septum.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgeons are medical professionals with specialized training in plastic and reconstructive surgery who perform cosmetic procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The surgeon is the medical professional who performs the pyloromyotomy operation on the infant.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1a321ea72ebe4c42d67faa7f47af64c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5f40938298f68915d43c1e7cdd62e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5d994bc1563d4fe5ab322fe7f3808&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5972068248f50904396788f92782210f</data>
