  <data key="d2">Asia is a continent where wild ginseng faces extinction threats and where cultivated North American ginseng is exported.&lt;SEP&gt;Asia is a continent where large outbreaks of hepatitis E have occurred due to poor sanitation.&lt;SEP&gt;Asia is a region where rabies is common in developing countries.</data>
