<node id="Developing Countries">
  <data key="d0">Developing Countries</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Developing countries with overcrowding and poor sanitation have high prevalence of Giardia infection.&lt;SEP&gt;Developing countries are regions where hepatitis E infection commonly occurs through contaminated water.&lt;SEP&gt;nations with limited resources where food shortages and undernutrition are common.&lt;SEP&gt;Developing countries are nations with lower economic resources where protein-energy malnutrition is a leading cause of child death.</data>
