<node id="Gestalt Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Gestalt Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Gestalt therapy is a humanistic therapy technique that emphasizes present-moment awareness of emotions and behaviors, with therapist and patient collaborating for self-understanding.</data>
