<node id="Therapist">
  <data key="d0">Therapist</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The therapist in Gestalt therapy does not interpret experiences but works jointly with the patient to foster self-understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;Therapist is a counselor or professional who provides psychotherapy through verbal exchange with a client.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83b914f2eb8e464a9d70f7d72f05cc69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80bdc5e62cc3de9c461969117469e796</data>
