<node id="Humanistic Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Humanistic Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Humanistic therapy is a therapeutic approach emphasizing personal growth and self-awareness, under which Gestalt therapy is categorized.&lt;SEP&gt;Humanistic Therapy is a therapeutic approach that preceded and provided the theoretical base for the Human-Potential Movement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2cb6182b9af5df2ef20938c28d082c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83b914f2eb8e464a9d70f7d72f05cc69</data>
