<node id="Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">simple sugar used by cells for energy, blood levels regulated by insulin and glucagon.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a simple sugar that circulates in the bloodstream and binds to hemoglobin during glycosylation.&lt;SEP&gt;A sugar used in the glucose loading test to suppress growth hormone secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a blood sugar molecule that may need balance adjustment when undergoing Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is a sugar molecule whose blood level is regulated by insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a4bfe90135432788559f3dd95da898ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e04fc4d9139221a4e00a150baf448e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96678691a6b9b46cb9e089fa58def217&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9afb199a3e40198055fdd9a325ecd1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a42943ad0f93e6631565dc2c851d36</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786412241</data>
</node>
