  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Episodic anemia that occurs&lt;SEP&gt;A condition characterized by the destruction of red blood cells leading to anemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemolytic anemia is a condition involving the destruction of red blood cells, often indicated by low haptoglobin levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6dcc52e74701dc594a5093895fbb8763&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5fe7cfd2eb995bee47dc8e7a28fbbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-692d93090ae85c6b6714d5c8ab674670</data>
