<node id="Graft-Versus-Host Disease">
  <data key="d0">Graft-Versus-Host Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Graft-Versus-Host Disease is an immune-mediated disorder where donor immune cells attack the recipient’s tissues after transplantation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07cc217c989e2af1a805d2ee5017b0b3</data>
