<node id="Growth Hormone (hGH)">
  <data key="d0">Growth Hormone (hGH)</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A hormone, also called somatotropin, responsible for normal body growth and development by stimulating protein production in muscle cells and releasing energy from fat breakdown.</data>
