  <data key="d2">(no description)&lt;SEP&gt;Lumbar puncture (spinal tap) is a diagnostic procedure that may be performed to aid in determining the cause of hydrocephalus when infection is suspected.&lt;SEP&gt;Lumbar puncture is a procedure that may be performed as part of the diagnostic workup for Parkinson’s disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Lumbar puncture is a medical procedure used to collect cerebrospinal fluid for diagnosing rabies.</data>
