<node id="Cordyceps Sinensis">
  <data key="d0">Cordyceps Sinensis</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cordyceps sinensis is a fungus used in conjunction with H-2 blockers to modulate and boost the immune system and improve respiration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="Eucalyptus Globulus">
  <data key="d0">Eucalyptus Globulus</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Eucalyptus globulus is a tree whose essential oil is added to a steam vaporizer to help clear chest and nasal congestion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="Peppermint">
  <data key="d0">Peppermint</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Peppermint (Mentha piperita) is a herb whose essential oil is added to a steam vaporizer to help clear chest and nasal congestion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="Steam Vaporizer">
  <data key="d0">Steam Vaporizer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A steam vaporizer is a device used to deliver essential oils of eucalyptus or peppermint for relieving chest and nasal congestion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="Traditional Antihistamines">
  <data key="d0">Traditional Antihistamines</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional antihistamines are medications used to control swelling and itching reactions caused by H-2 blockers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="H-2 Receptors">
  <data key="d0">H-2 Receptors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">H-2 receptors are protein receptors that, when bound by histamine, cause increased secretion of stomach acid.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402778</data>
</node>
<node id="Cimetidine (Tagamet)">
  <data key="d0">Cimetidine (Tagamet)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cimetidine, also known as Tagamet, is an H2 receptor blocker available in prescription and over‑the‑counter forms, noted as the least potent but approved for preventing upper gastro‑intestinal bleeding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402779</data>
</node>
<node id="Upper Gastro-Intestinal Bleeding">
  <data key="d0">Upper Gastro-Intestinal Bleeding</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Upper gastro‑intestinal bleeding is a medical condition that Cimetidine is approved to help prevent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402779</data>
</node>
<node id="Respiration">
  <data key="d0">Respiration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Respiration is a physiological process that Cordyceps aims to improve when combined with H-2 blockers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91f1f0521effbc46ec1f542169ae21ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786402779</data>
