<node id="Plastic Surgery">
  <data key="d0">Plastic Surgery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic surgery is a medical specialty mentioned as training for physicians performing hair transplantation.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic surgery is a specialized branch of surgery focusing on repairing, reconstructing, or enhancing skin and tissue appearance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-911965df6829052b543a44acd39296de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5972068248f50904396788f92782210f</data>
