<node id="Local Anesthetic">
  <data key="d0">Local Anesthetic</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Local anesthetic is the drug applied to numb the scalp during hair transplantation surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Local anesthetic is a medication injected around the cervix to numb the area before hysteroscopy.&lt;SEP&gt;Local Anesthetic is a medication used to numb the area during dental extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Local anesthetic is a drug used to numb the area during outpatient ptosis surgery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf2a4a7521a933797a5c97cd08b21a3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7a1c4e1372979af71be73cfdd576ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31523ff9a2a651ce41cbc96e86cccd97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911965df6829052b543a44acd39296de</data>
