  <data key="d0">Hearing Aids</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A device that amplifies sound waves to help deaf or hard‑of‑hearing people hear more clearly.&lt;SEP&gt;Hearing aids are assistive devices employed to mitigate auditory deficits associated with Patau Syndrome.</data>
