  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The thin membrane of the ear where the Earlens device rests.&lt;SEP&gt;The eardrum, also called the tympanic membrane, is a thin wall that separates the outer ear from the middle ear and vibrates in response to sound.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cdefae7e49b6c54d31689577054a271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9af0d9e28259265f55fcf42bbb724f</data>
