<node id="Yoga">
  <data key="d0">Yoga</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Yoga is a Sanskrit-derived practice meaning ‘union’, from which Hatha Yoga is a branch.&lt;SEP&gt;Yoga is a key term associated with Pilates.</data>
