<node id="World Health Organization">
  <data key="d0">World Health Organization</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">World Health Organization is an international health body cited as the source of the Atlas of Heart Disease and Stroke, providing authoritative health information.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization provides global health statistics, reporting about 55,000 deaths per year from rabies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-910d4bcf6932bd29fd1d161e11852b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a89a85dc3be8d37412b0c61ebf99cb</data>
