  <data key="d0">Lifestyle Changes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lifestyle Changes refer to modifications in daily habits such as diet and activity, recommended as a treatment approach for heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Lifestyle changes are a combination</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-910d4bcf6932bd29fd1d161e11852b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b4f1384d965014ddcabd93b7495e501</data>
