<node id="Chest Tubes">
  <data key="d0">Chest Tubes</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Chest tubes are medical devices inserted after heart surgery to drain blood from the chest cavity as the surgical site heals.&lt;SEP&gt;Chest tubes are drainage devices used after thoracic surgery to remove fluid from the incision site.</data>
