</node>
<node id="Infant">
  <data key="d0">Infant</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An infant is a newborn patient who may be diagnosed with congenital heart defects at birth.&lt;SEP&gt;Infant is a newborn, especially one born prematurely before 37 weeks gestation.&lt;SEP&gt;Infant refers to a young child whose pupils may be dilated with mydriatic agents for Red Reflex Testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3db6c2b2025b59f4b58a91f35ae965a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56ef10afa5a5d842dfa90eafc05da760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c63f65bb800d3d7fae8a0864fc3cdf3</data>
