<node id="Cardiac Transplantation">
  <data key="d0">Cardiac Transplantation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cardiac Transplantation is an alternative name for Heart Transplantation, referring to the same surgical procedure of replacing a diseased heart with a donor heart.</data>
