<node id="Heart Valve Replacement">
  <data key="d0">Heart Valve Replacement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Heart Valve Replacement is a surgical procedure that removes a damaged heart valve and substitutes a healthy one, typically lasting three to five hours and covered by most insurance plans.</data>
