<node id="Blood Studies of Iron">
  <data key="d0">Blood Studies of Iron</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood studies of iron, including transferrin‑iron saturation and ferritin concentration, are common diagnostic methods for hemochromatosis.</data>
