<node id="Alcohol Poisoning">
  <data key="d0">Alcohol Poisoning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alcohol poisoning occurs when excessive alcohol is consumed, leading to health complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol Poisoning is a type of poisoning referenced in the treatment discussion, lacking a specific antidote.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fe1b59b257b5d344c7de5181dbff9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3978e5151245a8ce567b224992eabb69</data>
