<node id="Undernutrition">
  <data key="d0">Undernutrition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Undernutrition is a condition of lacking proper nutrition, associated with excessive alcohol consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;chronic deficiency of calories, protein, micronutrients leading to health issues, especially among elderly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9acb51065e727736eeeac34449f610b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe1b59b257b5d344c7de5181dbff9d0</data>
