<node id="Viruses">
  <data key="d0">Viruses</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Viruses are microscopic agents that can cause liver inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Viruses are microscopic infectious particles that serve as infective agents and can cause viral infectious diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;Viruses are microscopic pathogens that may cause pneumonia, especially in young children.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf8d23aad485a31e434afa128d656202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47a3a83e48113d48f0a14a70afb7ebf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe1b59b257b5d344c7de5181dbff9d0</data>
