</node>
<node id="Worms">
  <data key="d0">Worms</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Worms are larger organisms that can cause liver inflammation.&lt;SEP&gt;Worms are multicellular parasitic organisms that can act as infective agents, causing helminthic infectious diseases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf8d23aad485a31e434afa128d656202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fe1b59b257b5d344c7de5181dbff9d0</data>
