<node id="Pathogen">
  <data key="d0">Pathogen</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pathogen is a general term for disease‑causing agents such as the hepatitis B virus.&lt;SEP&gt;Pathogen is a biological agent, such as a virus or bacteria, that can cause disease.</data>
