  <data key="d0">Autoimmune Hepatitis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoimmune Hepatitis is a severe disease where the body's immune system attacks liver cells, causing inflammation and a range of symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3978e5151245a8ce567b224992eabb69</data>
