<node id="Fatigue">
  <data key="d0">Fatigue</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fatigue is a symptom of autoimmune hepatitis characterized by persistent tiredness.&lt;SEP&gt;Fatigue is a common symptom of influenza described as a feeling of extreme tiredness.</data>
