<node id="Fluids">
  <data key="d0">Fluids</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Fluids are ingested liquids that help maintain hydration during illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluids are liquids whose increased intake helps reduce constipation and prevent straining during bowel movements, supporting treatment of rectal prolapse.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79f9159512d902b809ff6ebeca7cf146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0caa0df876843ee924756d881922e0a8</data>
