<node id="Carbonated Beverages">
  <data key="d0">Carbonated Beverages</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbonated beverages are drinks that can trigger hiccups, especially when consumed through a straw.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbonated beverages are fizzy drinks that can exacerbate indigestion and are suggested to be avoided.</data>
