  <data key="d2">The spleen is an organ of the lymphatic system involved in immune function and blood filtration.&lt;SEP&gt;The spleen is an organ that may rupture if strenuous activity is performed during infectious mononucleosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d88b3e0c879cd2c524008f697f6859f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad90a1c52c5adcfcef0c32801d2597f</data>
