<node id="Human Bite Wounds">
  <data key="d0">Human Bite Wounds</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human bite wounds are injuries caused by purposeful bites or accidental collision of mouth and teeth with another individual's skin, posing high infection risk due to rapid bacterial growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Closed-Fist Injury">
  <data key="d0">Closed-Fist Injury</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Closed-fist injury, also called fight bite, is the most common form of human bite in adults where the skin over the knuckle joint is broken when a fist strikes teeth during a fight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Bite Injuries">
  <data key="d0">Bite Injuries</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bite injuries, including animal and human bites, account for about 1% of emergency room visits and are more common in summer months.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Animal Bites">
  <data key="d0">Animal Bites</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Animal bites are injuries caused by animals that contribute to approximately 1% of emergency room visits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Emergency Rooms">
  <data key="d0">Emergency Rooms</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergency rooms are medical facilities where bite injuries are treated, receiving about 1% of visits due to bites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Summer Months">
  <data key="d0">Summer Months</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Summer months are a seasonal period during which bite injuries occur more frequently.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
<node id="Debridement">
  <data key="d0">Debridement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Debridement is the medical procedure of removing dead tissue and foreign objects from a wound to prevent infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786409037</data>
</node>
