</node>
<node id="Medications">
  <data key="d0">Medications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medications refer to pharmaceutical treatments used to manage infection risk in bite wounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Various medications can cause nondeliberate immunosuppression as side effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b29429d857edf1192105634eda51b928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b12e63d79b206980d9b85d5beb720662</data>
