<node id="Vaginal Cancer">
  <data key="d0">Vaginal Cancer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vaginal Cancer is a malignant tumor of the vagina, for which Human Papillomavirus is implicated in about 40% of cases.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer in the vagina that can be detected through a Pap test.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d126a4f2dfaa975afdfed278c2386bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3c3c73e1fc719b81a2fc054715a4c</data>
