  <data key="d2">Sperm is the male reproductive cell that fertilizes the egg to begin pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm are the male reproductive cells used to fertilize eggs during IVF.&lt;SEP&gt;Sperm are the male reproductive cells whose quantity and health affect fertilization.</data>
