<node id="Osteoporosis">
  <data key="d0">Osteoporosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Osteoporosis is a bone‑weakening disorder cited as a possible outcome of elevated homocysteine.&lt;SEP&gt;Osteoporosis – Concept – description: decrease in bone mass and density leading to fragile bones and fractures.&lt;SEP&gt;Osteoporosis is a condition of reduced bone density that can result from prolonged hypercalcemia in hyperparathyroidism.</data>
