  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Homocystinuria is a rare genetic disorder that causes large amounts of homocysteine to be excreted in the urine and is associated with intellectual disability and early‑onset heart disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Homocystinuria is a rare inherited metabolic disorder characterized by excessive excretion of homocyste...</data>
