  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hookworm disease is mentioned in the text in relation to homocysteine metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;Hookworm disease is an illness caused by two types of S‑shaped worms that infect the human intestine.</data>
