  <data key="d0">Intellectual Disability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intellectual disability is a developmental condition noted in the text as being associated with homocystinuria.&lt;SEP&gt;Intellectual Disability is a profound cognitive impairment that may be present in individuals with Patau Syndrome.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96db15f8221b080d39a0f8664e928222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3046439ce6fa1d6d5f63b57269a3f9b</data>
