<node id="HLA Test">
  <data key="d0">HLA Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The HLA test, also known as HLA typing or tissue typing, is a diagnostic test that identifies antigens on white blood cells to determine tissue compatibility for organ transplantation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59ae7c2e485dd251483e45f48ced8031</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
