<node id="Autoimmune Disorder">
  <data key="d0">Autoimmune Disorder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An autoimmune disorder is a condition where the immune system attacks the body’s own tissues, mentioned in key terms.&lt;SEP&gt;An autoimmune disorder is a condition where the immune system attacks the body’s own tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where the body's immune system produces antibodies that mistakenly target and damage its own tissues, such as blood platelets in ITP.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune disorder is mentioned as a key term related to Peyronie's disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune disorder describes a condition where the immune system attacks the body's own tissues, a category applicable to psoriatic arthritis.</data>
