<node id="Palliative Care">
  <data key="d0">Palliative Care</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Palliative care relieves discomfort without curing disease and includes medical care, pain management, and emotional and spiritual support tailored to individual patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Palliative care is a multidisciplinary approach to relieving physical, psychological, emotional, social, and spiritual suffering in patients with chronic or terminal illnesses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8d8bc300bfed3b9ae37a020ae857ae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329ac66938be7de8f3fecbe3eafea694</data>
