  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">device that may benefit individuals with normal pressure hydrocephalus.&lt;SEP&gt;A shunt is a surgically implanted tube that drains cerebrospinal fluid from the brain ventricles to another body site, typically the abdominal cavity, and contains a one‑way valve.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-414a580eb00a7d0d58696314c2aa7dfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a51c332fdfaf8c96be6ab58c809b221</data>
