  <data key="d2">Hydrotherapy, also called water therapy, is the use of water (hot, cold, steam, or ice) to relieve discomfort and promote physical well‑being.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydrotherapy is mentioned as a key term related to treatment approaches for pervasive developmental disorders.</data>
