  <data key="d0">Severity Level Unknown</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Severity Level Unknown indicates the unknown severity of the Human-Potential Movement condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Severity Level Unknown signifies that the severity of conditions treated with proton pump inhibitors is not specified in the entry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2cb6182b9af5df2ef20938c28d082c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0747cef262212b19792ffedcc3323ca</data>
