  <data key="d0">Radiation Treatments to the Neck</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Radiation treatments to the neck can appear decades later and may lead to primary hyperparathyroidism, a cause of hypercalcemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ccd7967460bd192566c346ccf6adf5af</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786410112</data>
</node>
