<node id="Leg">
  <data key="d0">Leg</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9a8349d932728e6875da544c19a0cc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f69c2450b3e8a6ce90d873db565dfb3</data>
  <data key="d2">Elevation is applied to an injured leg by raising it above heart level.&lt;SEP&gt;Leg is the body part whose veins are examined in impedance phlebography.</data>
