  <data key="d0">Indigestion</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Indigestion is a disease/condition characterized by uncomfortable fullness, epigastric pain, and burning sensation in the upper abdomen, often occurring during or after meals.</data>
