  <data key="d0">Influenza Vaccination</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A vaccination used to protect individuals against the viruses that cause influenza, helping to protect people against getting influenza, though protection is imperfect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f49c33435524f5d8ed6badce93b4057</data>
