<node id="Pap Test">
  <data key="d0">Pap Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A diagnostic procedure, also known as a Pap smear, where a physician scrapes cells from the cervix or vagina to check for cervical cancer, vaginal cancer, or abnormal changes.</data>
