<node id="Exocrine Pancreatic Cancer">
  <data key="d0">Exocrine Pancreatic Cancer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A critical oncological disease where cancer cells originate in the exocrine tissues of the pancreas.&lt;SEP&gt;Exocrine pancreatic cancer is a type of pancreatic cancer that arises from the exocrine tissue of the pancreas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ecef8b1cb75d3c911d063994b3f226f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7165a537192620d6a93befeffa64e1</data>
