<node id="Cognitive-Behavioral Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Cognitive-Behavioral Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A documented treatment for paruresis aimed at reorganizing abnormal emotional schemes arising from anxiety-generating triggers.&lt;SEP&gt;Cognitive-Behavioral Therapy combines cognitive and behavioral techniques to change thoughts, behavior, and attitudes, and includes deep breathing and muscle relaxation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f07ae0c28dc0d57b8d89d819ee884b1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af3b4b939a2aeb8a2dffe85570c09b57</data>
