  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An anticoagulant medication whose levels in the blood must be carefully monitored to prevent clots or excessive bleeding.&lt;SEP&gt;Heparin is an anticoagulant medication used to treat blood clots and is monitored using the Partial Thromboplastin Time test.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f07ae0c28dc0d57b8d89d819ee884b1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec14d30df69d510d9dcaa9c0f8a32fd9</data>
