  <data key="d0">Poisoning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Poisoning is listed as a possible cause of brain cell degeneration leading to parkinsonism.&lt;SEP&gt;Poisoning is a medical condition where substances interfere with normal body functions after ingestion, inhalation, injection, or absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-13d7186c36bc114fd063d81d9835a694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2887ebc17d5fa167b3627fd14696de82</data>
