<node id="Rubella">
  <data key="d0">Rubella</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rubella is a viral infection that, when contracted by the fetus before birth, can increase the risk of patent ductus arteriosus.&lt;SEP&gt;Rubella (German measles) is a virus that, when infants are exposed in utero, poses a high risk for severe birth defects such as heart defects, blindness, and deafness.&lt;SEP&gt;Rubella is an infection</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ec71b0a5c34e36d6cca673cad0a2921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2178c16160f72fcce4eafd8e4952fe8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aaba17abb4736d74e87427bd6bce0a3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786422810</data>
</node>
<node id="Preterm Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Preterm Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Preterm delivery is the birth of a baby before full term, which is listed as a risk factor for patent ductus arteriosus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2178c16160f72fcce4eafd8e4952fe8f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786419023</data>
</node>
<node id="High Altitude Birth">
  <data key="d0">High Altitude Birth</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Birth at high altitude is an environmental factor that can increase the chance of patent ductus arteriosus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2178c16160f72fcce4eafd8e4952fe8f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786419023</data>
</node>
<node id="Surgical Closure">
  <data key="d0">Surgical Closure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Surgical closure is a procedure used to close the ductus arteriosus when medication does not succeed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2178c16160f72fcce4eafd8e4952fe8f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786419024</data>
</node>
