<node id="Partial Thromboplastin Time">
  <data key="d0">Partial Thromboplastin Time</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Partial Thromboplastin Time is a blood test used to investigate bleeding disorders and to monitor patients taking the anticoagulant heparin by assessing clotting factor activity.</data>
