</node>
<node id="Blood Clotting">
  <data key="d0">Blood Clotting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood clotting is the physiological process of forming clots within blood vessels&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Clotting is the physiological process in which platelets participate to stop bleeding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ec14d30df69d510d9dcaa9c0f8a32fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c07ccd2ac226d52ffc3c4068cddb090e</data>
