  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The pelvis is a butterfly-shaped group of bones at the base of the spine, forming a major ring and two smaller rings that support and protect internal organs.&lt;SEP&gt;The pelvis is the bony cavity in which the rectum resides and forms part of its anatomical boundaries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c41a54f033c3125532e18065a7b6c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ccba52c964c301daf559927d7d7c5e0</data>
