<node id="Pericardium">
  <data key="d0">Pericardium</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The pericardium is the sac (or membrane) that surrounds the heart muscle, normally containing a small amount of fluid that cushions and lubricates the heart.</data>
