<node id="King Louis XV of France">
  <data key="d0">King Louis XV of France</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">King Louis XV of France was the monarch whose personal physician, Francois Gigot de la Peyronie, documented the disease later named after him.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91b63fc7d102b55c2843666075d6ad7e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786420389</data>
</node>
<node id="Minor Trauma During Sexual Activity">
  <data key="d0">Minor Trauma During Sexual Activity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Minor trauma incurred during sexual activity, such as bending the penis, is a common cause of Peyronie's disease.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91b63fc7d102b55c2843666075d6ad7e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
