  <data key="d0">A. Glauberman/Photo Researchers, Inc.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A. Glauberman/Photo Researchers, Inc. is credited for providing a photo showing a polycystic kidney next to a normal kidney.</data>
