<node id="Premature Ejaculation">
  <data key="d0">Premature Ejaculation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Premature ejaculation is a disease/condition where male orgasm occurs before a man wishes it or too quickly during intercourse, commonly reported as a sexual complaint among men and couples, especially teenage and inexperienced males.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7d587f9f19560db27d69e4aa7b4fee1</data>
