  <data key="d2">A ruptured artery is a damaged blood vessel that can cause nonischemic priapism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c10fb15c165fb1c6b20b0aa8847da7ef</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786423958</data>
