<node id="Proctitis">
  <data key="d0">Proctitis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proctitis is a severe inflammation of the rectum, primarily affecting adolescents, adults, and men around age 30, and is associated with various sexually transmitted and inflammatory diseases.</data>
