  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chronic bacterial prostatitis is a gradual, long‑lasting form of prostatitis caused by bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Chronic bacterial prostatitis is a long‑lasting form of prostate infection associated with risk factors such as age and alcohol use.</data>
