  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cystoscopy is a diagnostic procedure mentioned in relation to prostatitis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is an endoscopic procedure for visual inspection of the bladder interior.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystoscopy is an endoscopic technique that can be used as an approach for performing a prostate biopsy.</data>
