<node id="Protein-Energy Malnutrition">
  <data key="d0">Protein-Energy Malnutrition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Protein-energy malnutrition (PEM) is a potentially fatal body-depletion disorder caused by insufficient protein and calorie intake, leading to severe health deterioration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afbff98c4c1d63870e1df4480f9167fa</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786424859</data>
